# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002557> (black pudding)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002557> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002557> "Black pudding is a type of blood sausage originating in Great Britain and Ireland. It is made from pork blood, with pork fat or beef suet, and a cereal, usually oatmeal, oat groats or barley groats. The high proportion of cereal, along with the use of certain herbs such as pennyroyal, serves to distinguish black pudding from blood sausages eaten in other parts of the world."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002557> "Damion Dooley")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002557> "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Black_pudding"^^xsd:anyURI)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.org/dc/terms/date> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002557> "2019-04-09T14:05:09Z"^^xsd:dateTime)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002557> "black pudding"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002557> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03316919>)

