AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00003204> "A variety of banana plant native to Micronesia"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00003204> <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-8844-9165>)
