AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00003251> "A castrated adult cattle male (occasionally a female or in some areas a bull) kept for draft or riding purposes."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00003251> <http://orcid.org/0000-0002-8844-9165>)
