AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00003251> "Ox as a prefix may also be used to refer to some carcass products from any adult cattle, such as ox-hide, ox-blood, oxtail, or ox-liver. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cattle#Terminology]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00003251> "ox"@en)
