AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00003337> "percent daily value"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00003337> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000032>)

