AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411078> "Slicing or \"globe\" tomatoes are the usual tomatoes of commerce, used for a wide variety of processing and fresh eating."@en)
