AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411135> "Numerous species of sea snails and freshwater snails. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Snail]"@en)
