AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411136> "Suidae is a family of artiodactyl mammals which are commonly called pigs, hogs or boars."@en)
