AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411364> "rheum spp."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411364> "rhubarb plant"@en)
