AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411501> "Morus , a genus of flowering plants in the family *Moraceae *, comprises 10-16 species of deciduous trees commonly known as mulberries, growing wild and under cultivation in many temperate world regions. The closely related genus *Broussonetia * is also commonly known as mulberry, notably the paper mulberry, *Broussonetia papyrifera *.  [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Morus_(plant)]"@en)
