AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411543> "beech nut tree"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411543> "fagus spp."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411543> "LanguaL curation note: When indexing beech nut index both *BEECH [B1543]* and *FRUIT [C0167]* (or its more precise narrower terms)."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411543> "beech tree"@en)
