AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411714> "A mature male chicken with coarse skin, toughened and darkened meat, and hardened breastbone tip."@en)
