AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411746> "Cyanobacteria also known as blue-green algae, blue-green bacteria, and  *Cyanophyta*) is a phylum of bacteria that obtain their energy through photosynthesis."@en)
