AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412133> "Castanospermum australe A.Cunn. & C.Fraser ex Hook.")
