# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412218> (coconut crab family)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412218> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412218> "Coenobitidae are the family of terrestrial hermit crabs, widely known for their land-living habits. They are found in coastal tropical regions around the world and require access to the ocean to breed. There are 17 species in two genera: Coenobita Latreille, 1829; Birgus Leach, 1816. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Coenobitidae]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412218> <http://eol.org/pages/2604272>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412218> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B2218>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412218> "coenobitidae"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412218> "land hermit crabs"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412218> "coconut crab family"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412218> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_02021446>)

