AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412543> "The Gonorynchiformes are an order of ray-finned fish that includes the important food source, the milkfish (*Chanos chanos*, family *Chanidae*), and a number of lesser-known types, both marine and freshwater.
The alternate spelling \"Gonorhynchiformes\", with an \"h\", is frequently seen but not official. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gonorynchiformes]"@en)
