AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412617> "Carp are various species of oily freshwater fish from the family *Cyprinidae*, a very large group of fish native to Europe and Asia. In colloquial use, carp usually refers only to several larger cyprinid species such as *Cyprinus carpio* (common carp), *Carassius carassius* (Crucian carp), *Ctenopharyngodon idella* (grass carp), *Hypophthalmichthys molitrix* (silver carp), and *Hypophthalmichthys nobilis* (bighead carp). [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carp]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412617> <http://eol.org/pages/3198>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412617> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B2617>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412617> "cyprinidae"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412617> "carp"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412617> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411921>)

