AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412801> "Fadogiella is a genus of flowering plants in the *Rubiaceae* family. It was descripted by Walter Robyns in 1928. This genus is morphologically similar to *Fadogia* and is related to the latter genus. It is found in central and east tropical Africa."@en)
