# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412941> (curled endive plant)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412941> "Curly endive, or frisée (var *crispum*). This type has narrow, green, curly outer leaves. It is sometimes called chicory in the United States and is called chicorée frisée in French."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03412941> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Endive>)
