AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03413974> "Rastrelliger is a mackerel genus in the family *Scombridae*. The three species of *Rastrelliger* together with the four species of *Scomber* comprise the tribe Scombrini, known as the \"true mackerels\": Short mackerel, *R. brachysoma* (Bleeker, 1851); Island mackerel, *R. faughni* Matsui, 1967.; Indian mackerel, *R. kanagurta* (Cuvier, 1816)."@en)
