# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414314> (yellow onion plant)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414314> "The brown onion or yellow onion (*Allium cepa *L.) is a variety of dry onion with a strong flavour. They have a greenish-white, light yellow, or white inside, its layers of papery skin have a yellow-brown or pale golden colour. It is higher in sulphur content than the white onion, which gives it a stronger, more complex flavour."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414314> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Yellow_onion>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414314> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B4314>)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414314> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_4679>)

