AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414604> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414604> "Fucus is a genus of brown algae found in the intertidal zones of rocky seashores almost throughout the world. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fucus]"@en)
