AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414625> "Elseya is a genus of large side-necked turtles, commonly known as Australian snapping turtles, in the family *Chelidae*. Species in the genus *Elseya* are found in river systems in northern and northeastern Australia and throughout the river systems of New Guinea."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000119> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414625> <https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Elseya>)
