# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414641> (spiny chiton)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414641> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414641> "Acanthopleura is a genus of chitons in the family *Chitonidae*. In this genus the girdle is spiny or spiky. It has eight described species at present."@en)
