# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414650> (cissus grape plant)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414650> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414650> "Cissus is a genus of approximately 350 species of lianas (woody vines) in the grape family (*Vitaceae)*. They have a cosmopolitan distribution, though the majority are to be found in the tropics. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cissus]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414650> <http://eol.org/pages/61156>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414650> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B4650>)
