AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414653> "Uvaria is a genus of flowering plants in the soursop family, *Annonaceae*. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Uvaria]"@en)
