AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414660> "cordia plant"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414660> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411024>)

