AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414670> "passionflower plant"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414670> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03413391>)

