# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414683> (brown pine plant)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414683> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414683> "Podocarpus is a genus of conifers, the most numerous and widely distributed of the podocarp family, *Podocarpaceae*. The genus occurs from southern Chile north to Mexico in the Americas and from New Zealand north to Japan in the Asia-Pacific region. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Podocarpus]"@en)
