# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414684> (araucaria tree)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414684> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414684> "Araucaria is a genus of evergreen coniferous trees in the family *Araucariaceae*. There are 19 extant species in New Caledonia (where 13 species are endemic), Norfolk Island, eastern Australia, New Guinea, Argentina, Chile, and southern Brazil. The edible large seeds of *Araucaria araucana*, *Araucaria angustifolia* and *Araucaria bidwillii* - also known as Araucaria nuts, and often called, although improperly, pine nuts - are eaten as food (particularly among the Mapuche people and Native Australians). In South America Araucaria nuts or seeds are called piñas [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Araucaria]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414684> <http://eol.org/pages/4067>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414684> <http://www.ars-grin.gov/cgi-bin/npgs/html/taxon.pl?460224>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414684> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B4684>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414684> "PLANTS:ARAUC2")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414684> "Araucaria")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414684> "Araucaria Juss.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414684> "Araucaria spp.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414684> "araucaria spp."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414684> "auracaria nut"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414684> "araucaria tree"@en)
