AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414686> "Beilschmiedia bancroftii (F. M. Bailey) C. T. White")
