AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414698> "Cyathea is a genus of tree ferns, the type genus of the fern order *Cyatheales*. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Cyathea]"@en)
