AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414700> "Livistona is a genus of palms (family *Arecaceae*), native to southern and southeastern Asia, Australasia, and the Horn of Africa. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Livistona]"@en)
