AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414772> "Heliotropium is a genus of flowering plants in the borage family, *Boraginaceae*. There are 250 to 300 species in this genus, which are commonly known as heliotropes. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Heliotropium]"@en)
