AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414792> "water ribbon"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414792> "arrowgrass plant"@en)
