AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414817> "In Australia larvae of some psyllids, for example *Psylla eucalypti*, hide under a protective shield of crystallized honeydew.In this form it is called lerp or lerp scale. [http://en.foodlexicon.org/h0002600.php]"@en)
