AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414849> "equus"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414849> "equine animal"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414849> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411134>)

