AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414913> "rock samphire plant"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414913> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03411566>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414915> (sea lavender plant)

