AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03415071> "Echinacea is a genus, or group of herbaceous flowering plants in the daisy family. The *Echinacea* genus has nine species, which are commonly called coneflowers. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Echinacea]"@en)
