AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03415093> "Archidendron jiringa (Jack) I. C. Nielsen")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03415093> "Archidendron jiringa (Jack) I.C. Nielsen")
