AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03415144> "alchemilla"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03415144> "lady's mantle plant"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03415144> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03413359>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03415147> (rockrose plant)

