AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03415168> "Marsdenia cundurango is a species of plant of the genus *Marsdenia* with the common name Condurango. It is native to Peru and Ecuador in South America. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Marsdenia_cundurango]"@en)
