AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03415181> "Arenga is a genus of palms, native to Southeast Asia, southern China, New Guinea, and northern Australia. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Arenga]"@en)
