AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03430144> "Food material which is in a physical state between a solid and a liquid."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03430144> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=E0144>)
