AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03430144> "slush"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03430144> "thixotropic (state)"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03430144> "LanguaL curation note: Used for soft food products that are formable or spreadable but not pourable. The product may be smooth or contain discrete particles."@en)
