AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03430147> "LanguaL curation note: Used only for solid food products, i.e. hard or soft products capable of retaining a definite shape at room temperature (20 degrees C.). Examples of whole formed products are: whole cheese, apple pie, loaf of unsliced bread, noodle, yeast tablet and cornflake."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03430147> "whole, shape achieved by forming"@en)
EquivalentClasses(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03430147> ObjectIntersectionOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03430131> ObjectSomeValuesFrom(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/RO_0002353> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00002409>)))
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03430147> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03430131>)

