# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480010> (packed in vinegar with sugar)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480010> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480010> "A mixture of vinegar and sugar which are used as a packing medium for food material."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480010> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=K0010>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480010> "In the U.S., grain strength is calculated as 10 times the acid content expressed as acetic acid.  For example, 40 grain vinegar = 4% acetic acid; 120 grain vinegar = 12% acetic acid. [Technically Speaking about Vinegar - A food technologist's guide to vinegar, The Vinegar Institute, 5775 Peachtree-Dunwoody Road, Atlanta, Georgia 30342, USA].
LanguaL curation note: Used for sweetened vinegar-water mixture with grain of at least 10. For lower grain, use *PACKED IN SWEETENED LIQUID*."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480010> "packed in vinegar with sugar"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480010> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480029>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480011> (packed in edible medium)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480011> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480011> "Packed in a medium that is also a food product."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480011> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=K0011>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480011> "LanguaL curation note: Ingredients that are introduced through the packing medium are indexed as appropriate under *INGREDIENT OR FOOD ADDED* found in *H. TREATMENT APPLIED*."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480011> "packed in edible medium"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480011> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480020>)

