# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480020> (food packing medium)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480020> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480020> "The medium in which the food is packed for preservation and handling or the medium surrounding homemade foods, e.g., peaches cooked in sugar syrup. The packing medium may provide a controlled environment for the food. It may also serve to improve palatability and consumer appeal."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480020> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=K0020>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480020> "food packing medium"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03480020> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_00003368>)

