AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510029> "Pet animals as a consumer group; products are labeled accordingly."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510029> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=P0029>)
