AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510031> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=P0031>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510031> "pet dog as consumer"@en)
