AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510060> "high calorie food"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510060> "[REGULATION (EC) No 1924/2006 Corrigendum 2007-01-18]
LanguaL curation note: Renamed from *HIGH CALORIE FOOD* [LanguaL 2008]."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510060> "high energy food claim"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510060> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510045>)

