# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510248> (high unsaturated  fat)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510248> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510248> "A claim that a food is high in unsaturated fat, and any claim likely to have the same meaning for the consumer may only be made where at least 70 % of the fatty acids present in the product derive from unsaturated fat under the condition that unsaturated fat provides more than 20 % of energy of the product [COMMISSION REGULATION (EU) No 116/2010 of 9 February 2010 amending Regulation (EC) No 1924/2006 of the European Parliament and of the Council with regard to the list of nutrition claims].."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510248> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=P0248>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510248> "high unsaturated  fat"@en)
SubClassOf(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510248> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510247>)

# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03510249> (source of omega-3 fatty acids)

