AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03530218> "A food object quality which describes the integrity of the medium in which the food is packed for preservation and handling or the medium surrounding foods."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000116> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03530218> "Previous definition was a legacy definition, not ontological and has been moved to comments. Updated examples of usage to remove plastic usage as describes packaging not packing medium."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000117> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03530218> "http://orcid.org/0000-0001-8008-8249")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03530218> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=Z0218>)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03530218> "Previous definition: It is important to distinguish whether the food in question has been drained or not drained when evaluating the nutrient content.
Related term to PRESENCE OF PACKING MEDIUM is K.  PACKING MEDIUM."@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:label <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03530218> "food packing medium integrity"@en)
