AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03530253> "Foods produced in accordance with Council Regulation (EC) No 834/2007 of 28 June 2007 on organic production and labelling of organic products and repealing Regulation (EEC) No 2092/91."@en)
