# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_102329> (Pinctada margaritifera)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_102329> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_102329> "*Pinctada margaritifera*, commonly known as the black-lip pearl oyster, is a species of pearl oyster, a saltwater clam, a marine bivalve mollusk in the family Pteriidae. This species is common in the Indo-Pacific within tropical coral reefs."@en)
