AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_115624> "*Herniaria glabra*, known as smooth rupturewort, is a plant of the family *Caryophyllaceae*. Growing in North America and Europe. It contains herniarin, a methoxy analog of umbelliferone. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Herniaria_glabra]"@en)
