AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_129327> "*Liasis fuscus* is a non-venomous python species found in Australia and Papua New Guinea. Common names: brown water python, water python."@en)
