AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_13385> "*Calluna vulgaris* (known as common heather, ling, or simply heather) is the sole species in the genus *Calluna* in the flowering plant family *Ericaceae*. *Calluna vulgaris* herb has been used in the traditional Austrian medicine internally as tea for treatment of disorders of the kidneys and urinary tract. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Calluna]"@en)
