AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_159053> "Limonia acidissima is the only species within the monotypic genus Limonia. Common names for the species in English include wood-apple and elephant-apple.Limonia acidissima is a large tree growing to 9 metres (30 ft) tall, with rough, spiny bark."@en)
