AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_181181> "*Lithospermum arvense*, the field gromwell, corn gromwell, or bastard alkanet, is a flowering plant of the family *Boraginaceae*. It is also known as *Buglossoides arvensis*. The European Union has granted the refined oil of the seed of *Buglossoides arvensis* novel food status and some farmers are growing it. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lithospermum_arvense]"@en)
