AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_233707> "*Manilkara kauki is a plant in the subfamily *Sapotoideae*, and the tribe *Sapoteae* of the *Sapotaceae* family; and is the type species for the genus *Manilkara*. Throughout the world it is known generally by the name caqui, but in Australia it is called wongi. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Manilkara_kauki]"@en)
