AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_320146> "Chaenomeles japonica (Thunb.) Lindl. ex Spach")
