AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_34199> "*Aloe vera* is a species of succulent plant of the genus Aloe that probably originated in northern Africa."@en)
