AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_3712> "\"It is considered to be closer to wild cabbage than most domesticated forms. The species *Brassica oleracea* contains a wide array of vegetables including broccoli, cauliflower, collard greens, and brussels sprouts. The cultivar group Acephala also includes spring greens and collard greens, which are extremely similar genetically.\" - Wikipedia"@en)
