AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_37176> "Ovibos moschatus (Zimmermann, 1780)")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_37176> "musk ox"@en)
