AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_376798> "Canary grass is a plant, *Phalaris canariensis*, belonging to the family *Poaceae*. Originally a native of the Mediterranean region, it is now grown commercially in several parts of the world for birdseed. In the Canary Islands, Italy and North Africa, P. canariensis is used as food. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Canary_grass]"@en)
