AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_3886> "*Phaseolus coccineus*, known as runner bean, scarlet runner bean, or multiflora bean, is a plant in the legume or *Fabaceae* family. Another common name is butter bean, which, however, can also refer to the lima bean, a different species."@en)
