AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_400990> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_400990> "*Solanum centrale*, the kutjera, or Australian desert raisin, is a plant native to the more arid parts of Australia. Like other \"bush tomatoes\", it has been used as a food source by Central Australia and Aboriginal groups for millennia."@en)
