# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_43700> (Monopterus albus)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_43700> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_43700> "A commercially important, air-breathing species of fish in the Synbranchidae family. Originating in the waters of East and Southeast Asia, it has been identified as an invasive species in the North American Everglades."@en)
