AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_438424> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_438424> "*Limnophila aromatica* (synonym: *Limnophila chinensis* var. *aromatica*; also called rice paddy herb) is a tropical flowering plant in the plantain family, *Plantaginaceae*. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Limnophila_aromatica]"@en)
