# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_45181> (Mitchella repens)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_45181> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000428>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_45181> "*Mitchella repens* (partridge berry or squaw vine) is the best known plant in the genus *Mitchella*. It is a creeping prostrate herbaceous woody shrub occurring in North America belonging to the madder family (Rubiaceae). The scarlet berries are edible but rather tasteless, with a faint flavour of wintergreen, resembling cranberries (to which they are not closely related). They are often confused with the Newfoundland \"partridgeberry\" which is actually a relative of the lingonberry. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mitchella_repens]"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000118> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_45181> "partridge berry plant"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_45181> <http://eol.org/pages/1107478>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_45181> <http://www.ars-grin.gov/cgi-bin/npgs/html/taxon.pl?402637>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_45181> <http://www.itis.gov/servlet/SingleRpt/SingleRpt?search_topic=TSN&search_value=35063>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_45181> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B4960>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_45181> "PLANTS:MIRE")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_45181> "Mitchella repens L.")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_45181> "mitchella repens"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_45181> "squawvine"@en)
