# Class: <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_452416> (Origanum onites)

AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000114> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_452416> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000122>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_452416> "*Origanum onites*, the Cretan oregano, Turkish oregano, pot marjoram, is a plant species in the genus Origanum found in Sicily, Greece and Turkey. It has similar flavors as oregano. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Origanum_onites]"@en)
