AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_48042> "Lovage, *Levisticum officinale*, is a tall perennial plant, the sole species in the genus Levisticum in the family *Apiaceae*, subfamily *Apioideae*. The leaves can be used in salads, or to make soup or season broths, and the roots can be eaten as a vegetable or grated for use in salads. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lovage]"@en)
