AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_49825> "*Genista tinctoria* (dyer's greenweed or dyer's broom) is a species of flowering plant of the family *Fabaceae*. The plant has been used in popular medicine and herbalism for various complaints, including skin diseases, even in modern times. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Genista_tinctoria]"@en)
