AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_52824> "*Brassica carinata* (Ethiopian rape, Ethiopian mustard, Abyssinian mustard) is a member of the Triangle of U species  in the agriculturally significant *Brassica* genus. The plant is also grown as a leaf vegetable, with a mild flavor. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brassica_carinata"@en)
