AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_55577> "*Dioscorea cayennensis* subsp. *rotundata*, the \"white yam\", sometimes sold as \"Guinea yam\" or \"white ñame\", is a subspecies of yam native to Africa. It is one of the most important cultivated yams.[https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dioscorea_cayennensis_subsp._rotundata]"@en)
