AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_77327> "Vigna adenantha (G. Mey.) Maréchal, Mascherpa & Stainier")
