AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_80379> "The habanero chili was disseminated by Spanish colonists to other areas of the world, to the point that 18th-century taxonomists mistook China for its place of origin and called it *Capsicum chinense* (\"the Chinese pepper\"). [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Habanero]"@en)
