AnnotationAssertion(<http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/IAO_0000115> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_82096> "*Eleutherococcus senticosus* is a species of small, woody shrub in the family Araliaceae native to Northeastern Asia.  *E. senticosus* has a history of use in folklore and traditional Chinese medicine. Root extracts of E. senticosus are sold as a dietary supplement or cosmetic, usually under the name Siberian ginseng. [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eleutherococcus_senticosus]"@en)
