AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_8475> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B4385>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_8475> "Chelydra serpentina (Linnaeus, 1758)")
