AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_8855> "Cairina moschata (Linnaeus, 1758)")
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_8855> "barbary duck"@en)
