AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_8915> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B4569>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_8915> <https://www.fao.org/fishery/en/aqspecies/low>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_8915> "Larus fuscus Linnaeus, 1758")
