AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/NCBITaxon_97441> <http://www.itis.gov/servlet/SingleRpt/SingleRpt?search_topic=TSN&search_value=22122>)
