AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414179> "xerula radicata"@en)
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414179> "A widespread Agaric mushroom readily identified by its deeply rooted stalk (stipe)."@en)
