AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414183> "A common jelly fungus in the family Tremellaceae. It is most frequently found on dead but attached and on recently fallen branches, especially of angiosperms, as a parasite of wood decay fungi in the genus Peniophora."@en)
