AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414325> "A beefsteak tomato (American English) or beef tomato (British English) is any of the largest varieties of cultivated tomatoes, some weighing 1 pound (450 g) or more."@en)
