AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414533> "Hypsizygus tessulatus (Bull.) Singer")
AnnotationAssertion(rdfs:comment <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414533> "Bunapi-shimeji was selected from UV-irradiated buna-shimeji (brown beech mushroom) and the breed was registered as 'hokuto shiro #1' by Hokuto Corporation."@en)
