AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414534> <http://www.indexfungorum.org/names/NamesRecord.asp?RecordID=317053>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasDbXref> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414534> <http://www.langual.org/langual_thesaurus.asp?termid=B4534>)
AnnotationAssertion(<http://www.geneontology.org/formats/oboInOwl#hasNarrowSynonym> <http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/FOODON_03414534> "Lyophyllum shimeji (Kawam.) Hongo")
